  "subject": "Original-client ordinary Alia Das arrival route toward Rogers after S6 transfer",
  "setup": "Isolated copied 1.16.5.0 client/server/DB from the S6 transfer in bootcamp-s5-postbomb-ordinary-exit-20260924.json. No GM travel, live Docker or DIT change. Movement after run 17 was not persisted by harness shutdown; for continuation-only runs 18-21, the copied character coordinate was explicitly edited to the ordinary-reached run-17 point. Those continuation runs produced no playable HUD/movement result.",
